{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bucketing","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A bucket is the 32-bit FNV-1a hash of the UTF-8 bytes of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"id + \":\" + flagKey"},{"type":"text","text":", passed through murmur3’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"fmix32"},{"type":"text","text":" finalizer and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"taken modulo 10,000. Rollout and weight percentages cover 100 buckets per"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"point, so a 1% rollout is buckets "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0..<100"},{"type":"text","text":". The same input always"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"produces the same bucket."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The finalizer keeps one ID’s buckets for different flags independent, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"two flags’ small cohorts overlap at the rate chance predicts. Without it,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the low bits of an FNV-1a hash depend only on the low bits of the input"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bytes, and one flag’s bucket partly determines another’s."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is not GrowthBook’s bucketing (different input layout, finalizer,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and string encoding), so buckets don’t carry over from GrowthBook."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Changing this function re-buckets every user and reshuffles"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every running experiment, so it changes only in a major release."}]}],"name":"Important","type":"aside"}]}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Pure functions for stable feature-flag bucketing."}],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Bucketing"}],"title":"Bucketing","roleHeading":"Enumeration","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Bucketing","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxFeatureFlags"}],"externalID":"s:18SwiduxFeatureFlags9BucketingO","symbolKind":"enum"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxFeatureFlags\/documentation\/SwiduxFeatureFlags\/Bucketing","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxFeatureFlags\/documentation\/SwiduxFeatureFlags\/Bucketing\/bucket(id:flagKey:)","doc:\/\/SwiduxFeatureFlags\/documentation\/SwiduxFeatureFlags\/Bucketing\/isInRollout(bucket:rollout:)","doc:\/\/SwiduxFeatureFlags\/documentation\/SwiduxFeatureFlags\/Bucketing\/variantIndex(bucket:weights:)"],"title":"Type Methods","anchor":"Type-Methods"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxFeatureFlags\/documentation\/SwiduxFeatureFlags"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxfeatureflags\/bucketing"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://SwiduxFeatureFlags/documentation/SwiduxFeatureFlags/Bucketing":{"title":"Bucketing","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Bucketing","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Pure functions for stable feature-flag bucketing."}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxFeatureFlags\/documentation\/SwiduxFeatureFlags\/Bucketing","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bucketing","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxfeatureflags\/bucketing"},"doc://SwiduxFeatureFlags/documentation/SwiduxFeatureFlags/Bucketing/bucket(id:flagK